  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Sknfed is an independent, family-run British skincare brand creating natural, organic, vegan and cruelty-free products in London. Our approach is centred on skin nutrition—thoughtfully formulated skincare designed to nourish, replenish and support healthy, comfortable skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">We welcome genuine skincare creators, bloggers and publishers who want to introduce Sknfed through original reviews, educational content and authentic organic social media. Affiliates can earn commission when customers discover and purchase our products through approved affiliate links.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Paid advertising, search ads, brand bidding, direct linking, cashback, browser extensions and unauthorised discount promotion are strictly prohibited. Affiliates must clearly disclose their relationship with Sknfed and provide accurate information about their identity, audience and promotional channels.</p></div>",
